cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the published features, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "physprobe: Do frozen video encoders and a generative video tokenizer see hidden object physics?"
abstract: >-
  Linear probes of frozen video representations (V-JEPA 2, DINOv2, random-weight controls and the
  NVIDIA Cosmos-Tokenize1 latent) for the hidden mass and friction of a pushed cube in MuJoCo,
  compared against pixel, tracker, state and contact baselines with identifiability controls.
  Course project, Modern Methods and Algorithms of Generative AI, Skoltech, 2026.
authors:
